{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"877641310650130522","content":"\"I haven't heard too much about you, just that you're pretty powerful and respectable. seemed like you're a bit too blunt for some people from the congress but you had good reasons for what you said. sounds like you're wanting to set some kind of standard, like a lot of people I used to know that dreamed big about how they wanted to change the world.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T00:32:22.449000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877711557704949811","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"877641310650130522","content":"(one sec)","created_at":"2021-08-19T00:35:56.921000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877712457265721375","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"877641310650130522","content":"The Mender chuckles \"I am blunt.... no reason to gild the lilly.... and yes while I am here... I hoped to do more than just my mission.... like help people embrace what they have.....\" he pauses a moment \"Imagine living with such magic, and being unwilling to use it.\" he shakes his head \"Regardless, a discussion for another day..... What do you think of the state of Empire City?\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T00:45:01.084000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877714739650785300","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"877641310650130522","content":"\"To be honest, a mess. war going on, hampstead is the pits, the fae neighborhood is just strange to me. and almost everywhere you look there's a lot of good people not even realizing who they're hurting. people starting rumors, starting fights sometimes. it all makes me...tired\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T00:49:25.813000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877715850004664320","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"877641310650130522","content":"\"Would you say this city is falling apart?\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T00:50:35.592000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877716142679007283","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"877641310650130522","content":"\"that, sounds a lot like what's happening. and if something doesn't change from the day to day it'll likely bleed into the nation people are trying to plant.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T00:53:44.392000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877716934563598336","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"877641310650130522","content":"\"Would you like to help me and my friends repair that which is broken... and set this city back on the right path.... even if it means keeping secrets from everyone outside this cottage?\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T00:54:46.118000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877717193461223494","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
